d net income in the third quarter of 2019 was $43.2 million or $1.48 per diluted share, compared to $36.0 million or $1.27 per diluted share last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/herc-holdings-inc-hri-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"HRI 2019 Q4","e":"hri","d":"2020-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Irion","x":"Delivering freight is an area where we've got some big cost savings in Q4 and will continue to benefit in 2020, given we focus on the efficiency of logistics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/27/herc-holdings-inc-hri-q4-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"HRI 2020 Q1","e":"hri","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Irion","x":"We are not anticipating significant layoffs in the current environment and are maintaining all the healthcare benefits.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/herc-holdings-inc-hri-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"HRI 2020 Q1","e":"hri","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Irion","x":"There will be an impact to our margins, despite the cost savings we have implemented.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/herc-holdings-inc-hri-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"HRI 2020 Q1","e":"hri","d":"2020-04-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark Irion","x":"Given the uncertainty of the impact of COVID-19 on future North American business activity and our business specifically, we are withdrawing our 2020 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/herc-holdings-inc-hri-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"HRI 2020 Q4","e":"hri","d":"2021-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Larry Silber","x":"Our full-year 2020 results, and then up, exceeding our revised expectations as we maintain positive pricing despite a decline in volume related to the COVID-19 business slowdown.","url":"https: