our investor day last September.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/10/herc-holdings-inc-hri-q4-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"HRI 2021 Q4","e":"hri","d":"2022-02-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark Irion","x":"We raised 2021 guidance three times last year and are raising our 2022 guidance from what we provided at our investor day last September.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/10/herc-holdings-inc-hri-q4-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"HRI 2022 Q1","e":"hri","d":"2022-04-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Rob Wertheimer","x":"And then just if you have any comment on what pricing looks like from the regionals in the industry, where the industry is kind of all following price increases and I'll stop there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/21/herc-holdings-inc-hri-q1-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"HRI 2022 Q1","e":"hri","d":"2022-04-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Larry Silber","x":"Based on the strength of our first quarter performance and our outlook for the rest of the year, we've raised our 2022 guidance for adjusted EBITDA again, and Mark Irion will discuss that in detail later this morning.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/21/herc-holdings-inc-hri-q1-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"HRI 2022 Q1","e":"hri","d":"2022-04-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark Irion","x":"That has the most impact on the lifted guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/21/herc-holdings-inc-hri-q1-2022-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"HRI 2025 Q1","e":"hri","d":"2025-04-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Larry Silber","x":"Now on slide number five, I want to take just a minute to preempt some of your questions about the current demand environment and the potential impact of tariffs on our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/herc-hri-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRI 2025 Q1","e":"hri","d":"2025-04-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Larry Silber","x":"When it comes to tariffs, we don't expect any direct impact to our procurement costs in 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/herc-hri-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRI 2025 Q3","e":"hri","d":"2025-10-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Aaron Birnbaum","x":"…that despite the uncertain sentiment in the general market around interest rate -- interest rates and tariffs, industrial spending and non-residential construction starts still show plenty of opportunity for growth, built on a foundation of mega project development and infrastructure investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/28/herc-hri-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HRI 2025 Q3","e":"hri","d":"2025-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lawrence Silber","x":"We want to pinpoint additional variable cost saving opportunities, discontinue activities that do not align with our strategic priorities, and eliminate inefficiencies at the local level.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/28/herc-hri-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HRI 2025 Q3","e":"hri","d":"2025-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Aaron Birnbaum","x":"First, we are rightsizing our acquired fleet and aligning brand consistency to drive operational efficiency and long-term value.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/28/herc-hri-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HRI 2025 Q3","e":"hri","d":"2025-10-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"W. Humphrey","x":"On Slide 16, we're reiterating our 2025 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/28/herc-hri-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HRI 2025 Q4","e":"hri","d":"2026-02-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Leslie Hunziker","x":"And you have mentioned positive pricing, stable local markets,","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/17/herc-hri-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRI 2025 Q4","e":"hri","d":"2026-02-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lawrence H. Silber","x":"Right out of the gate, we began a comprehensive restructuring of the combined assets addressing size, age, category classes, and brands to ensure alignment with customer demand and market opportunities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/17/herc-hri-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRI 2025 Q4","e":"hri","d":"2026-02-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lawrence H. Silber","x":"As a result of these actions and the progress we have made in eliminating redundant costs, optimizing procurement, and streamlining corporate functions, cost synergies are now tracking ahead of plan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/17/herc-hri-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRI 2026 Q1","e":"hri","d":"2026-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Tami Zakaria","x":"Could you just remind us how you manage that with in terms of your own costs and how you pass it on to customers and whether there's any lag?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/herc-hri-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRI 2026 Q3","e":"hri","d":"2026-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Aaron Birnbaum","x":"In the third quarter of 2025, we were actively rightsizing and aligning the acquired fleet.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/27/herc-hri-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[36,1,7819,0,0,0,7358,0],[37,1,5099,0,0,0,4489,350],[39,1,5997,0,0,0,4981,660],[40,1,5435,0,0,0,4887,311],[41,1,8944,0,0,0,6908,1655],[44,1,7635,0,0,0,6475,879],[48,1,9520,0,0,0,7729,1393],[49,1,8931,0,0,0,6578,1883],[60,1,7210,0,0,0,5792,1097],[61,1,6885,0,0,0,5027,1567],[63,1,6268,0,0,0,5086,999],[64,1,7877,0,0,0,6557,21],[65,1,6214,0,0,0,4240,1187],[6